      "id": 28233,
      "title": "Federico-Tena World Trade Historical Database",
      "description": "The Federico-Tena World Trade Historical Database reports the imports and exports of almost every country and colony from 1800 to 1938, at current and constant prices, and within both their borders at the time and their 1913 borders. Its world trade index measures the volume of world trade as the sum of all countries’ exports at constant prices.",
      "producer": "Federico and Tena-Junguito",
